<title>LEBANON: Solidere shares mixed in Beirut.</title>
<headline>Solidere shares mixed in Beirut.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidere shares were mixed on slightly lower turnover on the Beirut Stock Exchange on Thursday as A shares fell to $108 from Wednesday's $109 and B shares were steady at $114.</p>
<p>Turnover in Solidere shares was 4,427 shares from 4,959 on Wednesday and value was $489,278 from $548,545.625.</p>
<p>Also traded on the BSE were 6,000 Ciments Libanais shares at $1.156 unchanged from Wednesday.</p>
<p>There was no trade in the shares of the three other listed companies: Ciments Blancs, Eternit and Uniceramic.</p>
<p>The LISPI stock index fell 0.08 percent to 81.29 and the BLOM stock index also fell 0.22 percent to 932.89.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456 602057</p>
